---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>
  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-bg">
        <div class="clouds-bg"></div>
        <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
      </div>

      <nav class="navbar">
        <div class="container navbar-content">
          <div class="logo">✦ DREAMVERSE</div>
          <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="#fiestas">FIESTAS</a>
            <a href="#galeria">GALERÍA</a>
            <a href="#contacto">CONTACTO</a>
          </div>
          <a href="#contacto" class="cta-btn">¡MONTAMOS LA TUYA!</a>
        </div>
      </nav>

      <div class="hero-content container">
        <div class="hero-text">
          <p class="eyebrow">✨ FIESTAS PARA GENTE JOVEN ✨</p>
          <h1 class="hero-title">
            <span class="title-line">TU NOCHE</span>
            <span class="glow-text title-line">EXPLOTA</span>
            <span class="title-line">CON NOSOTROS</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="hero-desc">Música. Luces. Vibraciones que no se olvidan. Desde Madrid a todo lo que rodea.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="#contacto" class="btn btn-primary">QUIERO MI FIESTA →</a>
            <a href="#galeria" class="btn btn-secondary">VER FIESTAS ↓</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="floating-shapes">
        <div class="shape shape-1">🎉</div>
        <div class="shape shape-2">🎵</div>
        <div class="shape shape-3">✨</div>
        <div class="shape shape-4">🎶</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="fiestas" class="fiestas">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">¿QUÉ TIPO DE UNIVERSO CREAS?</h2>

        <div class="fiestas-grid">
          <article class="fiesta-card">
            <div class="card-img" style="background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519671482749-fd09be7ccebf?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80') center/cover;"></div>
            <div class="card-content">
              <h3>SUNSET PARTY</h3>
              <p>Atardecer, rooftop y las mejores ondas. Cuando empieza a oscurecer, empieza la magia.</p>
              <span class="tag">INTIMISTA</span>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="fiesta-card">
            <div class="card-img" style="background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1492684223066-81342ee5ff30?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80') center/cover;"></div>
            <div class="card-content">
              <h3>NEON BLAST</h3>
              <p>Luces, neón, discoteca y la energía al máximo. Esto es lo tuyo si quieres explotar.</p>
              <span class="tag">ELECTRIZANTE</span>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="fiesta-card">
            <div class="card-img" style="background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516450360452-9312f5e86fc7?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80') center/cover;"></div>
            <div class="card-content">
              <h3>PRIVATE UNIVERSE</h3>
              <p>Tu grupo, tu vibe, tus reglas. Una experiencia exclusiva para los tuyos.</p>
              <span class="tag">PERSONALIZADO</span>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="galeria" class="galeria">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">LO QUE CREAMOS</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Estos son momentos de nuestras fiestas. Podrían ser los tuyos.</p>

        <div class="gallery-grid">
          <div class="gallery-item" style="background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514525253161-7a46d19cd819?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80') center/cover;"></div>
          <div class="gallery-item" style="background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1493225457124-a3eb161ffa5f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80') center/cover;"></div>
          <div class="gallery-item" style="background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1487180144351-b8472da7d491?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80') center/cover;"></div>
          <div class="gallery-item" style="background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1459749411175-04bf5292ceea?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80') center/cover;"></div>
          <div class="gallery-item" style="background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504384308090-c894fdcc538d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80') center/cover;"></div>
          <div class="gallery-item" style="background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470225620780-dba8ba36b745?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80') center/cover;"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="stats">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="stat-box">
          <h3>500+</h3>
          <p>PERSONAS EN FIESTA</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-box">
          <h3>40+</h3>
          <p>FIESTAS ORGANIZADAS</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-box">
          <h3>100%</h3>
          <p>RECOMENDACIÓN</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contacto" class="contacto">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">¿TIENES UNA IDEA LOCA?</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Cuéntanos y hacemos que pase. Somos todos oídos.</p>

        <div class="contact-grid">
          <form class="contact-form" id="contactoForm">
            <input type="text" name="nombre" placeholder="Tu nombre" required />
            <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Tu email" required />
            <textarea name="mensaje" placeholder="¿Qué quieres celebrar?" rows="5" required></textarea>
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">ENVIAR MENSAJE →</button>
          </form>

          <div class="contact-info">
            <h3>CONTÁCTANOS</h3>
            <p class="info-item">📧 <a href="mailto:dreamverseesp@gmail.com">dreamverseesp@gmail.com</a></p>
            <p class="info-item">📱 <a href="tel:+34640254070">640 25 40 70</a></p>
            <p class="info-item">📍 Madrid & Alrededores</p>
            <p class="info-item social">💬 <a href="https://instagram.com/dreamverseesp" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">@dreamverseesp</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="footer">
      <div class="container">
        <p>© 2024 DREAMVERSE • Fiestas que se recuerdan • <a href="https://instagram.com/dreamverseesp" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">@dreamverseesp</a></p>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Layout>

<script>
  const form = document.getElementById('contactoForm');
  if (form) {
    form.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      const nombre = form.querySelector('input[name="nombre"]').value;
      const email = form.querySelector('input[name="email"]').value;
      const mensaje = form.querySelector('textarea[name="mensaje"]').value;
      const asunto = encodeURIComponent('Nueva solicitud de fiesta - ' + nombre);
      const body = encodeURIComponent(`Hola Dreamverse,\n\nNombre: ${nombre}\nEmail: ${email}\n\nMensaje:\n${mensaje}`);
      window.location.href = `mailto:dreamverseesp@gmail.com?subject=${asunto}&body=${body}`;
    });
  }

  const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
    entries.forEach((entry) => {
      if (entry.isIntersecting) {
        entry.target.classList.add('animate-in');
      }
    });
  }, { threshold: 0.1 });

  document.querySelectorAll('.fiesta-card, .gallery-item').forEach((el) => observer.observe(el));
</script>

<style>
  :root {
    --primary: #1598e6;
    --secondary: #7ce7ff;
    --accent: #d5f6ff;
    --sky-dark: #0d5b9f;
    --sky-mid: #1987da;
    --sky-light: #72d1f4;
    --dark: #0a0a0a;
    --white: #f8fdff;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
    background: #08131d;
    color: var(--white);
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }
  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  button, input, textarea { font: inherit; }
  .container {
    width: min(1200px, calc(100% - 32px));
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0b4e8a 0%, #1986d8 40%, #7bd8f5 100%);
  }

  .hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .clouds-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 12% 20%, rgba(255,255,255,0.8) 0 90px, transparent 96px),
      radial-gradient(circle at 26% 18%, rgba(255,255,255,0.85) 0 110px, transparent 116px),
      radial-gradient(circle at 42% 16%, rgba(255,255,255,0.75) 0 100px, transparent 106px),
      radial-gradient(circle at 62% 20%, rgba(255,255,255,0.8) 0 110px, transparent 120px),
      radial-gradient(circle at 78% 16%, rgba(255,255,255,0.8) 0 100px, transparent 108px),
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.04), rgba(0,0,0,0.18));
    opacity: 0.95;
  }

  .clouds-bg::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: url('/dreamverse-clouds.svg') center 0 / cover no-repeat;
    opacity: 0.96;
    transform: scale(1.12);
  }

  .clouds-bg::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 52%, rgba(255,255,255,0.18) 0%, transparent 30%);
  }

  .hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(3,31,53,0.18), rgba(5,65,105,0.18), rgba(127,218,236,0.12));
  }

  .navbar {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    padding: 15px 0;
  }

  .navbar-content {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .logo {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--white);
    text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255,255,255,0.28);
  }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 28px;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
  }

  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--secondary); }
  .cta-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 11px 18px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #071d2b;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(16,126,217,0.35);
  }

  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex: 1;
    padding-top: 60px;
    padding-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .hero-text {
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.96);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .hero-title {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(46px, 8vw, 106px);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 0.92;
    letter-spacing: -4px;
    margin: 0;
    color: #fff;
    text-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(0, 82, 168, 0.3);
  }

  .title-line { display: block; }
  .glow-text {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dffaff, #8ae1ff 28%, #ffffff 65%, #d9eefc 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
    text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
  }

  .hero-desc {
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 22px 0 30px;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 52px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0 26px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }
  .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .btn-primary {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
    color: #071d2b;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(16,126,217,0.35);
  }
  .btn-secondary {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    color: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
  }

  .floating-shapes {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 1;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .shape {
    position: absolute;
    font-size: 52px;
    animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
    text-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
  }
  .shape-1 { top: 18%; right: 10%; }
  .shape-2 { top: 38%; right: 5%; animation-delay: 0.6s; }
  .shape-3 { top: 62%; left: 9%; animation-delay: 1.1s; }
  .shape-4 { top: 27%; left: 7%; animation-delay: 1.5s; }

  .fiestas {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(9,21,31,0.96), rgba(10,15,24,0.96));
    padding: 90px 0 110px;
  }

  .section-title {
    margin: 0 0 52px;
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 6vw, 62px);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
    color: var(--white);
    text-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(124,231,255,0.3);
  }

  .fiestas-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 22px;
  }

  .fiesta-card {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(18,33,48,0.9), rgba(10,20,26,0.9));
    border: 1px solid rgba(124,231,255,0.25);
    border-radius: 18px;
    overflow: hidden;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }
  .fiesta-card.animate-in { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  .fiesta-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    border-color: rgba(124,231,255,0.6);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(21,152,230,0.15);
  }

  .card-img {
    height: 260px;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
  }

  .card-content {
    padding: 26px 22px 28px;
  }
  .card-content h3 {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: 22px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: var(--white);
  }
  .card-content p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }
  .tag {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 7px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(124,231,255,0.6);
    color: var(--secondary);
    background: rgba(124,231,255,0.08);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .galeria {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(8,18,29,0.98), rgba(22,40,52,0.96));
    padding: 80px 0 100px;
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    text-align: center;
    margin: -18px 0 34px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .gallery-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .gallery-item {
    min-height: 290px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    border: 1px solid rgba(124,231,255,0.22);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: scale(0.96);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
  }
  .gallery-item.animate-in { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
  .gallery-item:hover {
    transform: scale(1.02);
    border-color: rgba(124,231,255,0.7);
  }

  .stats {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a5f9d 0%, #0f87d8 44%, #70d8f3 100%);
    padding: 42px 0;
  }

  .stats .container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .stat-box h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 52px);
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    line-height: 1;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .stat-box p {
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
  }

  .contacto {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(8,15,20,0.96), rgba(9,18,28,0.98));
    padding: 90px 0;
  }

  .contact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    gap: 28px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .contact-form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 18px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(124,231,255,0.18);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 22px;
  }

  .contact-form input,
  .contact-form textarea {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 16px 18px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(124,231,255,0.25);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.025);
    color: var(--white);
    resize: vertical;
  }
  .contact-form input::placeholder,
  .contact-form textarea::placeholder { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); }
  .contact-form input:focus,
  .contact-form textarea:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: rgba(124,231,255,0.7);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(124,231,255,0.08);
  }

  .contact-info {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(20,46,65,0.72), rgba(12,18,26,0.92));
    border: 1px solid rgba(124,231,255,0.22);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 26px 22px;
  }
  .contact-info h3 {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
  }
  .info-item {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.82);
  }
  .info-item a { color: var(--secondary); }

  .footer {
    background: #040c12;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(124,231,255,0.2);
    padding: 24px 0;
    text-align: center;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .footer a { color: var(--secondary); }

  @keyframes float {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px) rotate(0deg); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-18px) rotate(4deg); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .fiestas-grid,
    .gallery-grid,
    .stats .container,
    .contact-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .navbar-content {
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .nav-links {
      gap: 16px;
      font-size: 11px;
    }
    .hero-content {
      padding-top: 38px;
      padding-bottom: 36px;
    }
    .hero-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
    }
    .btn {
      width: 100%;
    }
    .shape { font-size: 36px; }
    .gallery-item { min-height: 220px; }
  }
</style>
